# Copy to .env (gitignored) to override defaults for local development.
# .env is loaded by the CLI and the dev server (src/env.ts); it does not affect tests.

# Where personal (non-repo) projects keep their YAML source of truth and events.jsonl. Repo projects keep
# theirs in the checkout under .apm/ instead, so this only governs the home-dir store. Unset, it defaults
# to ~/.ai-project-manager. Point it at a repo-local path to keep dev projects out of that shared store.
# APM_STORE_DIR=./.dev/store
